WEBVTT

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:11.144
Ai, Just on my love

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:17.484
<i>Kono te de omae 0 mamoritai</i>

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:31.765
Honto no otoko o shitteiru kai?

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:35.903
Horeteru onna ni yowai sa

00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:40.107
Aitsu wa ore yori yasashikute

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:44.211
Aitsu wa ore yori tsuyoino kai

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:50.984
Tsuki yo ga tsumetaku

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.887
Kokoro terasu

00:00:54.788 --> 00:01:03.263
Omoi ga kage e to utsusarete

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.334
Ai, Just on my love

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:13.373
<i>Kono te de omae 0 mamoritai</i>

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:21.949
<i>Al onna jounetsu omae ga kureta mono</i>

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:33.694
I'm Orphen, a black sorcerer
from the Tower of Fangs.

00:01:34.027 --> 00:01:37.497
Five years ago, the magician
| looked up to, Azalie,

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:40.867
activated the Heavenly Beings'
Sword of Baltanders

00:01:40.867 --> 00:01:44.004
and became the magical beast Bloody August.

00:01:44.605 --> 00:01:47.374
After leaving the Tower of Fangs
in search of Azalie,

00:01:47.374 --> 00:01:49.776
I, with my apprentice Majic and Cleao,

00:01:49.776 --> 00:01:52.546
began a quest to restore Azalie
to her normal human state.

00:01:53.213 --> 00:01:55.282
Let's go Majic! Cleao!

00:01:55.282 --> 00:01:56.516
To our next adventure!

00:01:56.516 --> 00:01:57.818
To the next town!

00:01:59.219 --> 00:02:00.854
What are you?

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:05.659
So you are Orphen?

00:02:07.828 --> 00:02:08.862
| see.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:12.132
A worthy opponent, sorcerer.

00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:20.507
I am Killing Doll.

00:02:21.408 --> 00:02:24.211
| exist solely to execute my designated target.

00:02:25.579 --> 00:02:26.346
What?

00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:36.089
<i>OBEY My command, doll</i>

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:39.993
Sorcerous runes...

00:02:49.703 --> 00:02:50.604
Orphen!

00:02:50.604 --> 00:02:51.672
Master!

00:02:52.105 --> 00:02:53.440
You!

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:54.608
Cleao, no!

00:03:02.683 --> 00:03:04.184
What are you thinking?

00:03:04.184 --> 00:03:06.720
He's not an opponent you can stand against!

00:03:07.254 --> 00:03:09.122
Do not interfere, Stephanie.

00:03:12.559 --> 00:03:15.262
Just now, didn't he say, "Stephanie?"

00:03:15.262 --> 00:03:16.997
Is he a friend of yours?

00:03:17.364 --> 00:03:19.866
Sorcerers are your targets.

00:03:19.866 --> 00:03:21.868
This child is not a sorcerer.

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:23.970
| will exterminate those that interfere.

00:03:28.375 --> 00:03:29.643
Guide me,

00:03:31.078 --> 00:03:32.512
O Starling of Death!

00:03:44.191 --> 00:03:47.094
It blocked Master's magic so easily.

00:04:14.287 --> 00:04:15.522
Master!

00:04:15.689 --> 00:04:16.890
Orphen...

00:04:21.161 --> 00:04:22.162
The ruins!

00:04:36.943 --> 00:04:38.044
It disappeared.

00:04:38.445 --> 00:04:39.513
Orphen!

00:04:39.513 --> 00:04:40.847
Master!

00:04:47.821 --> 00:04:48.855
That is...

00:04:48.855 --> 00:04:51.158
So that's the reason for the earthquake.

00:04:53.927 --> 00:04:56.930
This time be prepared, you fake sorcerer!

00:04:56.930 --> 00:05:00.100
| the battle hound of Mazmaturia,
Volcan Polkano,

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:03.170
will pluck you to death
with a flower fortune telling!

00:05:03.436 --> 00:05:07.340
Forward, Rock Demon, Great Volcan's Best!

00:05:12.612 --> 00:05:14.181
W-wait, Big Brother!

00:05:15.115 --> 00:05:16.783
Don't try to stop me, Dortin.

00:05:16.783 --> 00:05:18.985
It's a bloodstained road ahead anyway.

00:05:21.254 --> 00:05:24.457
That's not it! Below! Below! Look at its feet!

00:05:25.792 --> 00:05:27.727
What feet?

00:05:35.368 --> 00:05:36.570
They're dead.

00:05:36.570 --> 00:05:37.904
Hey! Hey!

00:05:50.483 --> 00:05:52.285
What an aromal

00:05:52.519 --> 00:05:57.524
Even after being left out so long,
the coffee powder isn't damp.

00:05:57.858 --> 00:05:59.960
Hey, Cleao, how about you?

00:06:05.565 --> 00:06:08.235
If you don't want to talk about it,
you don't have to.

00:06:08.535 --> 00:06:11.738
After all, you aren't my partner anymore.

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:20.413
I'm the one who awoke the Killing Doll.

00:06:24.718 --> 00:06:30.257
Orphen, while I was doing what you asked,
researching the sorcerous runes...

00:06:55.515 --> 00:06:59.452
A long time ago when the Heavenly Beings
and sorcerers were at war,

00:06:59.452 --> 00:07:02.756
to annihilate the never weakening sorcerers,

00:07:02.756 --> 00:07:05.992
the Heavenly Beings created
that horrid Killing Doll.

00:07:06.359 --> 00:07:07.961
The Heavenly Beings created that?

00:07:07.961 --> 00:07:10.397
Annihilate sorcerers?

00:07:11.798 --> 00:07:14.901
To have awakened such a horrible thing now...

00:07:15.702 --> 00:07:17.304
How does it know your name?

00:07:18.405 --> 00:07:21.708
How does Killing Doll know your name?

00:07:21.708 --> 00:07:24.144
Th-that is because...

00:07:24.144 --> 00:07:28.348
No need to introduce yourself
just because you found it, right?

00:07:28.915 --> 00:07:31.017
Of course, it would be a different story

00:07:31.017 --> 00:07:33.853
if he looked like the kind of guy
who would make friends.

00:07:43.596 --> 00:07:45.665
Majic, coffee please.

00:07:52.472 --> 00:07:54.541
Have you ever been to Totokanta?

00:07:55.308 --> 00:07:59.679
Of course, Orphen said it was
his most favorite town.

00:08:00.714 --> 00:08:02.515
You know how even though
Orphen has that face,

00:08:02.515 --> 00:08:04.851
he's got a pretty strong sense of justice?

00:08:04.851 --> 00:08:09.356
So no matter where he goes,
he always stirs up trouble, at least once.

00:08:09.356 --> 00:08:10.690
Trouble?

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:14.194
Like standing up to bad guys and stuff,
that kind of thing.

00:08:14.461 --> 00:08:16.229
Oh, that kind of thing!

00:08:16.629 --> 00:08:21.368
Among the bad guys, sometimes
there are those with prestige and power,

00:08:22.268 --> 00:08:26.272
so the one that ends up getting
kicked out of town is Orphen.

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:30.043
No one helps him then, you know.

00:08:30.043 --> 00:08:32.879
The townspeople always pretend
that they didn't see anything.

00:08:35.815 --> 00:08:38.018
But Totokanta was different.

00:08:38.018 --> 00:08:41.521
There was one person there
who helped Orphen.

00:08:41.521 --> 00:08:42.822
One?

00:08:42.822 --> 00:08:44.991
He's the master of a bar.

00:08:45.492 --> 00:08:47.160
Mister Bagup?

00:08:47.594 --> 00:08:50.063
Maybe it was a name like that.

00:08:51.731 --> 00:08:57.504
A while after that, my travels with Orphen
came to a close here in Alenhatan,

00:08:57.504 --> 00:09:00.340
because I wasn't a sorcerer anymore.

00:09:01.441 --> 00:09:04.611
Say, Cleao, which would you choose?

00:09:05.779 --> 00:09:08.948
If you were to give Orphen some of
the mountain grapes over there,

00:09:08.948 --> 00:09:12.552
would you choose the red, ripe ones
over there, or the still blue ones?

00:09:12.752 --> 00:09:14.120
To Orphen?

00:09:14.454 --> 00:09:17.357
Which one? No joking around, now.

00:09:18.591 --> 00:09:20.226
I think the ripe ones!

00:09:20.226 --> 00:09:21.361
Why?

00:09:21.361 --> 00:09:24.664
Because the ripe ones are sweeter
and taste better, right?

00:09:26.199 --> 00:09:28.468
You are the one who wants
to eat the ripe ones.

00:09:28.468 --> 00:09:31.771
You see, Orphen likes the blue sour ones.

00:09:33.173 --> 00:09:36.943
You've still got a ways to go
to be Orphen's partner, don't you?

00:09:44.217 --> 00:09:46.152
What in the world are you doing?

00:09:46.152 --> 00:09:47.654
Master...

00:09:49.656 --> 00:09:51.391
Where did Orphen go?

00:09:54.194 --> 00:09:58.064
Well, when I thought he was looking at the map,
he says he's going to the canals,

00:09:58.064 --> 00:09:59.899
and then all of the sudden he...

00:09:59.899 --> 00:10:02.936
Canals? Why would he go
somewhere like that alone?

00:10:02.936 --> 00:10:04.504
That's just like Orphen.

00:10:05.738 --> 00:10:07.740
He's the one being targeted.

00:10:07.740 --> 00:10:08.908
What do you mean?

00:10:08.908 --> 00:10:10.310
Don't you understand?

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:15.815
Orphen went to settle things alone,
so as to not involve us.

00:10:20.553 --> 00:10:23.723
Wait, Cleao! I'll go, too! Cleao!

00:10:30.663 --> 00:10:33.733
Orphen's at the coliseum, Killing Doll.

00:10:35.802 --> 00:10:38.638
I'm sorry, Orphen.

00:10:56.456 --> 00:10:57.557
No good?

00:10:57.557 --> 00:10:59.259
Orphen!

00:10:59.259 --> 00:11:00.960
Master!

00:11:12.172 --> 00:11:14.174
That I do carry,
Sword of the Descending Demon!

00:11:31.958 --> 00:11:36.062
If these stone statues should run amok...

00:12:07.860 --> 00:12:10.730
This is a sign of our promise, Stephanie.

00:12:11.264 --> 00:12:14.067
It's all right. It's all right.

00:12:18.171 --> 00:12:19.839
Why if it isn't Steph!

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:21.541
Tim!

00:12:23.509 --> 00:12:25.411
What kind of face is that?

00:12:27.614 --> 00:12:31.217
Oh, that's right.
Here, we just got new ones in.

00:12:31.217 --> 00:12:32.585
Aren't they gorgeous?

00:12:32.585 --> 00:12:34.120
Want to take them with you?

00:12:38.091 --> 00:12:39.826
This isn't like you.

00:12:40.326 --> 00:12:43.596
The Steph I know
goes running straight ahead

00:12:43.596 --> 00:12:46.132
without looking to the side
when she decides on something.

00:12:46.132 --> 00:12:51.804
She's stubborn and careless but
the townspeople love that about her.

00:12:52.005 --> 00:12:53.473
Even me.

00:12:54.741 --> 00:12:57.277
Well... that is...

00:12:57.277 --> 00:13:00.780
Anyway, it doesn't suit you
to worry over something, Steph.

00:13:01.214 --> 00:13:03.416
| don't know what's worrying you,

00:13:03.416 --> 00:13:07.720
but in the end, you can't help
but do what you think is right, right?

00:13:08.388 --> 00:13:09.522
Tim...

00:13:21.668 --> 00:13:22.802
Steph?

00:13:23.369 --> 00:13:25.271
Farewell, Tim!

00:13:26.839 --> 00:13:28.775
Hey, Steph!

00:13:28.775 --> 00:13:29.942
Stephanie!

00:14:07.447 --> 00:14:10.717
Did Orphen really say that
he was going to the canals?

00:14:11.017 --> 00:14:12.085
Yeah...

00:14:15.555 --> 00:14:19.258
You've still got a ways to go
to be Orphen's partner, don't you?

00:14:20.159 --> 00:14:22.295
"Still got a ways?"

00:14:24.931 --> 00:14:27.433
It hurts, but it could be.

00:14:30.069 --> 00:14:31.270
Ouch!

00:14:32.038 --> 00:14:35.007
Who did that?
Who threw a rock at My Greatness?

00:14:35.875 --> 00:14:37.043
You two!

00:14:37.043 --> 00:14:39.345
What are you doing in a place like that?

00:14:39.345 --> 00:14:41.681
We're filling our bellies before we set off.

00:14:41.681 --> 00:14:44.851
It's a waste of time to stay long
in a town like this, you know.

00:14:45.318 --> 00:14:48.221
Because he can't control the situation,
we're going to run away.

00:14:48.554 --> 00:14:50.022
Don't say unnecessary things!

00:14:50.656 --> 00:14:51.991
Cleao!

00:14:51.991 --> 00:14:53.393
Steph?

00:14:53.393 --> 00:14:55.061
Orphen's at the coliseum.

00:14:55.695 --> 00:14:56.796
Hurry!

00:15:06.439 --> 00:15:07.640
Cleao!

00:15:08.241 --> 00:15:09.442
Hey!

00:15:09.442 --> 00:15:10.643
You are so noisy!

00:15:10.643 --> 00:15:13.413
My Greatness is dining right now!

00:15:13.846 --> 00:15:15.815
Want to make a deal with me?

00:15:27.593 --> 00:15:28.795
Damn!

00:15:30.096 --> 00:15:34.434
You are quite a challenge,
just as was etched into Stephanie's soul.

00:15:35.134 --> 00:15:37.236
But in the end, you are only a sorcerer.

00:15:38.704 --> 00:15:41.073
| have only to execute my designated target.

00:15:48.881 --> 00:15:50.716
Master,

00:15:50.716 --> 00:15:52.885
we're going to save you now!

00:15:53.619 --> 00:15:56.622
S-stupid, you'll be killed!

00:15:56.823 --> 00:15:58.391
Meddlers!

00:15:58.391 --> 00:16:01.327
One... two... three... four...

00:16:01.327 --> 00:16:03.863
Don't count your money!

00:16:03.863 --> 00:16:06.566
Hurry up and have this guy attack!

00:16:06.566 --> 00:16:11.471
Cheap, with this little money,
you ain't gonna get much of an attack.

00:16:11.471 --> 00:16:12.472
Hey...

00:16:23.149 --> 00:16:24.417
It's coming back!

00:16:38.231 --> 00:16:39.265
Majic!

00:16:45.304 --> 00:16:46.405
Orphen!

00:16:46.405 --> 00:16:47.673
You!

00:16:49.842 --> 00:16:51.511
Sorry, Orphen.

00:16:52.879 --> 00:16:58.885
When I awakened him, he read my soul
and found out about you.

00:16:59.085 --> 00:17:00.786
And then he came to threaten me.

00:17:02.188 --> 00:17:04.991
He threatened to destroy this town
if I didn't hand you over.

00:17:04.991 --> 00:17:07.593
This town of Alenhatan.

00:17:07.860 --> 00:17:09.328
The town?

00:17:09.862 --> 00:17:11.597
That's why ...

00:17:18.037 --> 00:17:19.705
I'm really sorry.

00:17:20.339 --> 00:17:23.209
| can't ask you to forgive me, can I?

00:17:23.209 --> 00:17:25.478
Steph, you idiot.

00:17:25.478 --> 00:17:27.280
There's nothing to forgive.

00:17:27.280 --> 00:17:29.615
You just did what anyone would do.

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:34.453
If I was in your shoes,
I'm sure I'd have done the same thing.

00:17:34.754 --> 00:17:36.422
You were not wrong.

00:17:36.422 --> 00:17:39.292
You like it, don't you? This town?

00:17:39.625 --> 00:17:41.127
Orphen!

00:17:46.132 --> 00:17:47.433
We're going, Steph!

00:17:47.433 --> 00:17:48.467
Okay!

00:17:52.738 --> 00:17:54.006
Ouch!

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:05.551
Master!

00:18:05.551 --> 00:18:07.553
You! When did you?

00:18:17.096 --> 00:18:20.333
Now, let's finish this, Killing Doll.

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:22.602
Fine.

00:18:30.509 --> 00:18:33.379
Me? I can't do that!

00:18:33.379 --> 00:18:34.947
Don't you want to be his partner?

00:18:34.947 --> 00:18:38.250
But I don't know what to do at all.

00:18:38.517 --> 00:18:41.220
Orphen doesn't have a chance
of winning in a head-on fight.

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:44.690
So you're going to give him
a chance to attack.

00:18:44.690 --> 00:18:46.926
A chance? How?

00:18:47.126 --> 00:18:48.728
Ask Orphen.

00:18:49.795 --> 00:18:52.898
| mean you should watch Orphen closely.

00:18:52.898 --> 00:18:55.801
If you do that, you will know
what you should do.

00:18:55.801 --> 00:18:57.269
Watch Orphen?

00:19:03.309 --> 00:19:04.744
Watch closely.

00:19:13.552 --> 00:19:16.222
Orphen means to move to the right.

00:19:16.222 --> 00:19:17.590
That means...

00:19:23.796 --> 00:19:24.864
Sword of Light...

00:19:25.498 --> 00:19:26.999
whom I do release!

00:19:28.768 --> 00:19:30.403
This can't be...

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:32.705
| exist... my designated...

00:19:33.406 --> 00:19:35.207
| exist... my designated...

00:19:35.207 --> 00:19:36.709
designated...

00:19:43.182 --> 00:19:45.084
I... I did it!

00:19:46.385 --> 00:19:48.120
| did it!

00:19:59.665 --> 00:20:00.933
Thanks!

00:20:17.683 --> 00:20:19.351
A man?!

00:20:19.618 --> 00:20:22.088
Is that true, Master?

00:20:22.254 --> 00:20:25.357
Yeah. She screwed up a big spell once
and injured herself pretty badly.

00:20:25.357 --> 00:20:28.427
Afterwards she said, "I need to heal
my whole body so I might as well..."

00:20:28.427 --> 00:20:31.263
And that's when Stephan became Stephanie.

00:20:32.198 --> 00:20:34.100
| can't believe it!

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:36.635
| was surprised at first too.

00:20:37.002 --> 00:20:39.972
But she's still the same Stephan inside,

00:20:39.972 --> 00:20:43.843
and together, well, you saw this time
it's just like before.

00:20:44.477 --> 00:20:48.714
Like I said, I'm the one who created
the chance for you to get Killing Doll.

00:20:48.714 --> 00:20:51.083
How many times are you going
to make me tell you?

00:20:51.083 --> 00:20:52.952
You're so persistent!

00:20:52.952 --> 00:20:55.588
Then I'll leave it at that, just for you.

00:20:55.588 --> 00:20:56.989
Oh, really?!

00:20:56.989 --> 00:20:59.058
You don't believe me at all!

00:20:59.058 --> 00:21:01.427
Makes me mad! Mad! Mad!

00:21:01.427 --> 00:21:04.163
So, she was a man?
| said it was me! Hey, Orphen!

00:21:04.163 --> 00:21:04.897
| said it was me! Hey, Orphen!

00:21:05.364 --> 00:21:06.665
Everyone!

00:21:09.368 --> 00:21:12.071
About that research, I'll let you know
the results as I investigate.

00:21:12.071 --> 00:21:13.606
I'll leave it to you.

00:21:13.606 --> 00:21:16.575
Just don't dig up any more
weird things, all right?

00:21:17.777 --> 00:21:20.045
Oh, well, when I do,
please take care of it again.

00:21:20.045 --> 00:21:22.815
Oh, that's right! Take this with you.

00:21:22.815 --> 00:21:25.284
You like them, don't you? Mountain grapes?

00:21:26.218 --> 00:21:27.953
And I wondered what it was!

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:31.791
Good!

00:21:36.862 --> 00:21:38.864
Steph, you tricked me, didn't you?!

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:45.204
Take care of Orphen, okay, Miss Partner?

00:21:46.605 --> 00:21:48.741
Yes, Miss Stephanie.

00:21:51.377 --> 00:21:55.681
She was a nice person,
wasn't she, Miss Stephanie?

00:21:55.681 --> 00:21:57.016
Well, yeah.

00:21:57.283 --> 00:21:58.851
But you know...

00:21:59.451 --> 00:22:01.253
But what, Cleao?

00:22:01.654 --> 00:22:06.592
| wonder if that guy knows
that Steph was once a guy?

00:22:14.266 --> 00:22:17.970
What? Leki got lost and
went somewhere, you say?!

00:22:17.970 --> 00:22:19.672
What? Like My Greatness cares?

00:22:19.905 --> 00:22:22.908
More importantly, we have to save the lady
who was assaulted by a pack of wild dogs

00:22:22.908 --> 00:22:24.577
and get a brace of rewards!

00:22:24.577 --> 00:22:27.346
Eewww! Why is the super evil sorcerer here?

00:22:27.346 --> 00:22:31.851
And aren't those kids the ones
| scammed money from earlier?!

00:22:32.084 --> 00:22:34.119
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:34.119 --> 00:22:35.754
Leki's small adventure
"Leki's Small Adventure."

00:22:35.754 --> 00:22:38.157
Ieki's small adventure
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:22:38.157 --> 00:22:39.091
Leki's small adventure

00:22:49.535 --> 00:22:53.606
Honto ni sukidatta anata ga inai

00:22:53.606 --> 00:22:57.676
Hajimete no koi todomatta

